{"item_uid": "學測83-science-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "小明用顯微鏡觀察植物表皮細胞的構造，試問下列敘述中，哪一項是正確的？", "options": {"A": "觀察細胞時，加亞甲藍液，主要在使核糖體更清楚", "B": "植物的表皮細胞具有葉綠體，因此葉子呈綠色", "C": "加碘液可使表皮細胞之葉綠體更易於觀察", "D": "在低倍鏡下所看到的細胞數目比在高倍鏡下多"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一對夫婦有三個親生子女，血型分別為 A 型、B 型、O 型。就血型的基因而言，這\n一對夫婦的基因型應為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "IAIA × IBIB", "B": "IAIA × IBi", "C": "IAi × IAIA", "D": "IAi × IBi"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "紫茉莉的花色是中間型遺傳，RR 為紅花，rr 為白花，而 Rr 為粉紅花。若一白花紫\n茉莉與一粉紅花紫茉莉雜交，則其子代的基因型應為何？", "options": {"A": "基因型全部為 Rr", "B": "基因型全部為 rr", "C": "基因型為 Rr，rr", "D": "基因型為 RR，Rr，rr"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在下列過程中，何者需要經過減數分裂？", "options": {"A": "受精卵進行分裂發育成胚", "B": "花的雄蕊產生花粉粒", "C": "綠豆種子萌發長出胚根", "D": "表皮細胞進行分裂產生新細胞"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
