{"item_uid": "學測83-science-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一個穩定的群落，其最大的特徵為何？\n甲、有明顯的消長現象\n乙、消長已停止\n丙、生物種類少，食物網簡單\n丁、生物種類多，食物網複雜", "options": {"A": "甲、丙", "B": "甲、丁", "C": "乙、丙", "D": "乙、丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "脊髓可分為灰質和白質兩部分，灰質內有較多的神經細胞體，白質內有較多的神經\n纖維，突觸是指兩個神經元相會之處。試問哪一部分的突觸比較多？", "options": {"A": "灰質", "B": "白質", "C": "灰質和白質的突觸一樣多", "D": "不一定，因部位不同而異\n-1-\n自然考科 第 2 頁\n共 11 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖 2 為一生態系的食物網，若水受到重金屬污染，則\n下列四類生物的體內，何者所含的重金屬可能最多？", "options": {"A": "水草", "B": "昆蟲", "C": "魚", "D": "蟹"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖 3 為白鼠心臟示意圖，圖中的探針（甲、乙、\n丙、丁）遇到血中的藥物時，儀器的指針均會偏\n移。小明在白鼠腹部注射藥物若干毫升後，觀察\n指針的反應，並依反應的先後順序紀錄，下列何\n者正確？", "options": {"A": "甲→乙→丙→丁", "B": "甲→丁→乙→丙", "C": "乙→丙→甲→丁", "D": "丁→乙→丙→甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "小華將牛奶貯存於不同溫度中 12 小時，以研究牛奶中細菌的數量與溫度的關係，\n結果如表一。試問可用下列何圖表示二者的關係？\n表一\n溫度 12 小時後細菌含量\n（℃） （個 / 毫升）\n4 4,000\n7 9,000\n10 18,000\n13 38,000\n16 453,000\n22 8,800,000\n28 55,300,000", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-science-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關沈積岩的敘述，何者正確？", "options": {"A": "經由沈積作用變成沈積岩的岩石原先都是沈積岩", "B": "沈積物經過造山運動，再熔融後始成為沈積岩", "C": "火成岩經過風化分解後立即成為沈積岩", "D": "沈積物經過成岩作用才固結成沈積岩"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
